 * This {{M|innate}} ability is in the {{Spellslot|4|5}}.
** {{Symbol|bonus cd}}
*** Does not reduce the ability's current cooldown value immediately upon leveling up.
** {{Symbol|Courier}}
*** Applies {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|marci_special_delivery}} on her {{M|faction}}'s [[Couriers]].
**** Reaches their max level on each allied heroes' respective hero level {{Symbol|HeroLvl|{{#expr:30-{{#var:Special Delivery type1 value1}}}}}}.
*** The ability effects are applied as follows to the unit:
***# Retrieve all items from Marci's stash within the {{M|fountain}} area.
***# {{Symbol|Teleport}}
***#* Applies the {{#var:Special Delivery value1}}-second [[teleport]] delay.
***# {{to}} {{hi|Marci}}
***#* The Courier attemps to transfer all {{M|items}} automatically to Marci, and then heads back to the {{M|fountain}}.
***#* Hence, the unit will remain still next to Marci in the following conditions:
***#** Has extra items within its {{M|inventory}}.
***#** When the unit did not transfer any items.

* {{cf|expr}}
** Ability {{M|cooldown}}: {{Code|{{#var:Special Delivery cd}} - ({{#var:Special Delivery basic1}} × SelfLvl)}}
<hr>
* {{cf|aghnotes}} Applies an {{A|Marci|Unleash}} pulse of its corresponding level centered around the summoned {{M|Courier}}, while the ability is active.
** Applies the following ability effects within the radius
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|marci_unleash_flurry_pulse_debuff}}
**# {{Symbol|Projectile|Ripple}} The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} component.
**# {{Symbol|Silence}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|marci_unleash_pulse_[[silence]]}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Special Delivery icon0}}
| desc = Marci whistles to instantly summon her courier to her. If the courier started in the fountain, it will take items from Marci's stash. After teleporting it will transfer these items to Marci and head back to the fountain.<br><br>Passively grants all allied couriers 3 bonus levels and 1 bonus health.
}}

