{{Debuffnotes
| name = Dispose
| desc = Instantly overrides the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy's current {{M|forced movement}} source.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** {{hi|Marci}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|O|21px]] {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} [[File:Dota2 Marci Dispose Segment icon.png|84px]]
*** Can Dispose units up to {{#expr:{{#explode:{{#var:Dispose value1}}|°}}*2}}° of a [[Wikipedia:Circular segment|circular segment]] in front of Marci's {{M|facing angle}} without {{M|turning}}, within the {{M|cast range}}.

* The ability effects are applied as follows on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy:
*# {{Symbol|Upward Movement}}
*#* {{M|Stun}}
*#* A forced [[upward movement]], with a max 150-arc height over Marci.
*#* {{M|Cannot act}}.
*#* This ability component can only be interrupted by the following sources:
*#** Either Marci's or the affected hero's {{M|death}}.
*#** Applying another forced movement source on the affected unit during the throw.
*#* When interrupted or if this ability component is unapplicable, Dispose prematurely applies the landing effects at the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} targeted unit's current location.
*# [[File:Dota2 Marci Dispose Visualized icon-1.png|105px]][[File:Dota2 Marci Dispose Visualized icon-2.png|105px]]
*#* {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Target|Area-Dummy}}
*#** The {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] landing distance varies correspondingly to the its previous location upon cast.
*#** Can land at max {{Code|{{#var:Dispose value3}}-distance}} from point [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|O|21px]] behind Marci.
*#* Applies the following ability effects to all enemy units within the landing radius, centered around, including the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] , upon landing:
*#** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|marci_dispose_debuff}}
*#** The landing {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
*#** {{Symbol|Trees}}
*#*** [[Trees]] within the landing radius are destroyed.
*# {{cf|aghnotes}} Applies an {{A|Marci|Unleash}} pulse of its corresponding level centered around {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] upon landing, while the ability is active.
*#* Applies the following ability effects within [[Wikipedia:Circle|Circle]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-f.png|F|21px]] :
*#*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|marci_unleash_flurry_pulse_debuff}}
*#*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Ripple}} The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} component.
*#*# {{Symbol|Silence}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|marci_unleash_pulse_silence}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Dispose icon0}}
| desc = Marci grabs an allied or enemy target and throws it effortlessly behind her, damaging and slowing the unit if it's an enemy. Any enemy units in the landing area will also be damaged and slowed.
}}

