 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Rebound icon0}}
| desc = Marci bounds to the targeted allied unit, choosing a direction and distance she will spring away from it. Upon reaching the unit, Marci lunges to her final destination, damaging and stunning enemies where she lands.<br><br>When Rebound is set to alt-cast, Marci brings the target ally with her to her final destination.<br><br>The ally receives {{#var:Rebound value3}} bonus movement speed for {{#var:Rebound value8}}s.
}}
