** The ability visual effects around Marci corresponds to the {{M|projectile}} launched upon cast.

* {{Symbol|Caster|Leap}}
** Has a 0.1 ‒ 0.2-second min and max duration, and a 200 ‒ 250-height respectively.
** With the position offset and leap distance, the actual min and max distance is {{#var:Rebound value5}} – {{calc|v1-{{#var:Rebound value5}}|v1={{#var:Rebound value1}}}}.

