fields.value:
 * {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Cannot self-target.
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|marci_bodyguard_self}}
*** Grants flat {{M|bonus attack damage}} based on the affected allied unit's current {{M|main attack damage}}, values are periodically checked and the bonus values are updated immediately.
*** {{Symbol|Lifesteal}}
**** Stacks additively with other [[lifesteal]] sources.
**** Can only restore as much as the attacked enemy unit's max {{M|health}}.
**** Cannot lifesteal off the following units:
***** {{M|Allied units|x}}.
***** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
****** However, Sidekick can lifesteal off of health-based ward-type units.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|bonus t4l}} Applies the {{M|strong dispel}} on both Marci and the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted ally.
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|marci_bodyguarded}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#* All ability components considers attack on enemy {{M|clones}} and {{M|creep-heroes}} as enemy heroes, {{M|illusions}} as creeps.
*#* Cannot be cast on the following allied units:
*#** {{M|Couriers}}
*#** {{M|Hidden}} units.
*#** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
*#* {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
*#** Grants the following bonus to the affected allied unit, with all aforementioned ability notes apply:
*#*** Flat {{M|bonus attack damage}}.
*#*** {{M|Lifesteal}}
*#*** {{Symbol|bonus db-all}}
*#**** Incoming damage sources depletes both Marci's and the buff-affected allied unit's [[barrier]] value.
*#**** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#***** The barrier value only restores upon Marci's successful attack on enemy heroes.
*# {{cf|aghnotes}} Applies an {{A|Marci|Unleash}} pulse of its corresponding level centered around {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted ally [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] upon cast, while the ability is active.
*#* [[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-5-1.png|84px]][[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-5-2.png|84px]]
*#** Can affect enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Bodyguard type1 cast range}}+{{#var:Bodyguard type5 value2 agh}}}}|agh}}-distance away with the [[cast range]] and [[effect radius]].
*#* Applies the following ability effects within [[Wikipedia:Circle|Circle]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] :
*#*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|marci_unleash_flurry_pulse_debuff}}
*#*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Ripple}} The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} component.
*#*# {{Symbol|Silence}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|marci_unleash_pulse_[[silence]]}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Bodyguard icon0}}
| desc = Passively grants Marci lifesteal and bonus attack damage.<br><br>When cast on an ally, she provides them with 75% of her passive lifesteal and attack damage bonus. Additionally Marci creates a shared all damage barrier for herself and her partner. As Marci attacks heroes, 30% of the damage dealt restores the barrier.
}}
{{Barriercard}}

